# Database naming

Canonical schema: [db/schema.sql](../../db/schema.sql). Naming locked by migration `000007_schema_naming_unification`.

## Rules

| Rule | Example |
| ---- | ------- |
| Schema | `mentorix` |
| Tables | `snake_case`, plural | `programs`, `trainer_clients` |
| Domain prefix | `auth_*`, `user_*`, `trainer_*`, `program_*` |
| Child tables | full parent prefix | `program_day_exercises` |
| PK | `id uuid` | |
| FK | `{role}_id` | `program_id`, `trainer_id` |
| Client in link | `client_user_id` → `users` | not `client_id` |
| Trainer FK | `trainer_id` → `trainers` | not `trainer_user_id` |
| Audit | `created_at`, `modified_at`, `created_by`, `modified_by` | |
| Soft delete | `deleted_at` | |
| Enums | `snake_case` + CHECK | `email_password`, `published` |
| Type columns | concrete name | `exercise_type` not `type` |
| UNIQUE | `{table}_{cols}_uniq` | |
| INDEX | `{table}_{col(s)}_idx` | |

## Program trees

```text
programs → program_weeks → program_days → program_day_exercises
program_versions → program_version_weeks → … → program_version_day_exercises
program_assignments
```

## Workflow

New migration → `db/queries/` → `sqlc generate` → `scripts/schema-sync.sh` → update feature doc tables (not full DDL in docs).

## Avoid (renamed in 000007)

`refresh_sessions`, `invites`, `link_codes`, `trainer_user_id`, `exercises.type`, `added_by`.
